--TEST--
signature help inside an attribute's parentheses shows its declaration as one signature, and with no key written the first required field is active, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`
--FILE--
<?nvs
/// Adds a database index over one or more columns.
attribute Index on class {
    /// Whether two rows may share values.
    unique?: bool,
    /// The column names, separated by commas.
    columns: string,
}

#[Index(<|>)]
class Order {}
--REQUEST--
signatureHelp
--EXPECT--
Index(unique?: bool, columns: string)
active columns: string
param unique?: bool | Whether two rows may share values.
param columns: string | The column names, separated by commas.
doc Adds a database index over one or more columns.
